    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>HTDS is a bi-weekly podcast, delivering a legit, seriously researched, hard-hitting survey of American history through entertaining stories. To keep up with History That Doesn’t Suck news, check us out <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.htdspodcast.com/">htdspodcast.com</a> or follow on <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.facebook.com/historythatdoesntsuck">Facebook</a> and <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.instagram.com/historythatdoesntsuck/">Instagram</a>: @historythatdoesntsuck. <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://htds.supercast.com/">Become a premium member</a> to support our work, receive ad-free episodes and bonus episodes.</p><p>Pre-order Prof. Jackson's new book <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferer" href="https://www.simonandschuster.com/books/Been-There-Done-That/Greg-Jackson/9781668062609">Been There Done That: How Our History Shows What We Can Overcome</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
